  "name": "Documentos relacionados aplicables a las GRE (versión 2.0)",
  "source": "Anexo 8 (catálogo 61) from the 'Catálogos' sheet of perunio-facturador/resources/reglas/reglas-validacion-gre-2026-09-25.xlsx: the cbc:DocumentTypeCode of each cac:AdditionalDocumentReference of a guía. Its 'GRE Aplicable' column becomes `gre-r` (remitente, 09) and `gre-t` (transportista, 31); ERROR 2692 rejects a código outside the guía's own list, and the name is what cbc:DocumentType should carry (OBSERV 4371 without it). flags.issuerRemitente and flags.issuerTransportista mark the códigos whose cac:IssuerParty RUC is mandatory on each guía (ERRORs 3380 and 3382: 01, 03, 04, 09, 12, 48 and 92 on the remitente; 01, 03, 04, 09, 12, 31 and 48 on the transportista). The códigos shared with Cat.01 (01, 03, 04, 09, 12, 31, 48) name the same documents there. No row is struck through. SUNAT's trailing spaces and the dangling ' - ' after 75's MINSA are trimmed.",
